@startuml
' Container + dua profil deployment — docs/proposal/08-arsitektur.md §8.1-8.2
node "Lab" {
  component "Kamera UVC" as CAM
  component "PC Edge\nAI_EDGE\nnative agent + recognition-core" as PC
  component "STB Gateway\ncapture + burst tanpa model" as STB
}
node "Server" {
  component "AI Service pusat\nrecognition-core" as AI
  component "Core API FastAPI\notoritas attendance tunggal" as API
  database "PostgreSQL\npgvector opsional" as DB
  component "Vue 3 SPA\ntoken Gentelella v4" as WEB
}

CAM --> PC
CAM --> STB
PC --> API : event idempoten + outbox SQLite
STB --> AI : burst JPEG LAN
AI --> STB : decision
STB --> API : event idempoten
PC --> API : discovery gallery + heartbeat
STB --> API : discovery gallery + heartbeat
AI --> API : tarik managed config via sync token
API --> AI : health probe via ai-readiness
WEB --> PC : preview loopback :8765 khusus AI_EDGE
API <--> DB
WEB --> API

note bottom of API
  AI_EDGE (default): inference lokal di PC lab.
  AI_CENTRAL (opsional): STB capture + burst max 5
  JPEG, inference di AI service pusat.
  Satu recognition-core untuk kedua profil (ADR-001).
end note
@enduml
